    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d158">

                <pb facs="0315" n="223" xml:id="pg223"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72Su/63</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Diplomatic Liaison Officer with the Supreme War
                        Council</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Frazier</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-05-03T11:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 3, 1918, 11 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 5.09 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>49. The Supreme War Council adopted a resolution on the 2d instant dissolving the
                    Executive War Board as its functions had been superseded by the agreement of
                        Beauvais<anchor n="1" xml:id="d158-f1"/> appointing a supreme commander.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Frazier</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d158-f1" n="1" xml:id="d158-f1-content">
                <p>Apr. 3, 1918. See telegram of the Secretary of War, Apr. 5, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg197">p. 197</ref>.</p>
            </note>
